    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269472</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_050_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ここが……
&lt;Red&gt;ヴァルハラ&lt;White&gt;……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This is...
&lt;Red&gt;Valhalla&lt;White&gt;...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269580</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_050_002&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>わたしたちの時代の
&lt;Red&gt;ヴァルハラ&lt;White&gt;と
ずいぶん違うね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's really different
from the &lt;Red&gt;Valhalla&lt;White&gt;
in our time, isn't it...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269644</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_050_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>どうした？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What's wrong?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269756</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_050_004&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>いえ……ずいぶん、
小さな町……っていうか
村なんだなって……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>No... It's just a really
small town... Or, um,
village, I guess...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270072</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_050_007&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>もともと差別で街を
追い出された人や</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's mostly people who
were chased out of their
towns due to prejudice...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270072</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_050_008&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>戦争で街をなくした人が
急ごしらえで作った村だしな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...or whose towns were destroyed
in wars, who threw this village
together as best as they could.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270140</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_050_009&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そうなんだ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270288</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_050_010&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>とりあえず、
私はバジルを
呼んでくる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Anyway, I'll go find
Basil and ask him
to meet you.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270288</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_050_011&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>君たちは適当に
村の中を見て回っててくれ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You two just look
around the village
until I come back.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
